acceptance:
- id: AC-C3D-R2-0
  statement: The current B02 production source/authority guard passes on the exact
    material basis without source modification.
  evidence_requirements:
  - test: node scripts/lafea-b02-production-source-guard.mjs
- id: AC-C3D-R2-1
  statement: R2 executes on the exact governed LAFEA material head derived by pinned
    V3.1 material-basis semantics, while the current provider-main delta is mechanically
    classified DISJOINT from EP sensitivity.
  evidence_requirements:
  - oracle: LOCAL_EXECUTION exact_basis.material_head equals the mechanically derived
      material head; material-basis drift against base-ref main is DISJOINT; coordination/base
      HEAD may be newer only through non-sensitive changes.
- id: AC-C3D-R2-2
  statement: Focused B02B production qualification executes and its raw stdout, stderr,
    exit code and timestamps are retained without repair during execution.
  evidence_requirements:
  - test: node scripts/lafea-b02b-production-check.mjs
- id: AC-C3D-R2-3
  statement: The aggregate B02 production sequence executes twice independently; each
    run retains raw stdout, stderr, exit code and timestamps, and any nonzero result
    remains the exact first failing witness.
  evidence_requirements:
  - test: node scripts/lafea-b02-production-sequence-check.mjs
  - oracle: two-run deterministic replay comparison
- id: AC-C3D-R2-4
  statement: If both aggregate runs PASS, the final B02E qualification receipt is
    retained from each run and semantic/result identity is compared for deterministic
    replay; PASS is not inferred if raw receipt extraction is incomplete.
  evidence_requirements:
  - oracle: two durable B02E receipt records plus comparison
- id: AC-C3D-R2-5
  statement: 'No product/source diff is introduced by R2; this EP grants evidence
    only and does not admit B-bar, BM-005 or #1862 implementation.'
  evidence_requirements:
  - oracle: post-run git status and product/source diff
- id: AC-C3D-R2-6
  statement: 'Numerical PASS is accepted for C3-D.1 only when the retained ordinary-route
    execution is independently inspectable as CURRENT_RESULT/currentAuthority with
    completed transaction and current recovery ancestry; otherwise R2 returns BLOCKED
    and routes specifically to the reconciled #1862 composition scope.'
  evidence_requirements:
  - oracle: repository-visible currentness/lineage record retaining source/domain/geometry/mesh/profile/solver-config/execution/recovery
      identities plus transaction status/hash
